<h2>Wind vs. surge: the central question</h2>
<p>In Sabine Pass, the most important claim question after a hurricane is usually what wind did and what water did. The answer decides which policy pays.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Wind and hail</strong> are covered by your TWIA policy (or your homeowners or commercial policy if it includes wind). That includes wind damage to roofs, siding, and windows, and rain that blows in through openings the wind created.</li>
